  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Grate carrot. Finely chop cucumber. Thinly slice onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67de33ec33388b05bf552a04/step-99af9400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot and onion until tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Add spicy taco seasoning (see ingredients), tomato paste and garlic, stirring until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in kidney beans, the stock powder, water and the butter and simmer, until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins. Season with salt and pepper to taste. (Add more water if the mixture looks dry!) Lightly mash kidney beans with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67de33ec33388b05bf552a04/step-b4713c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• Lay mini flourtortillas on a chopping board. Spoon kidney bean mixture down the centre and sprinkle over Cheddar cheese.\n• Roll tortillas up tightly and place, seam-side down, in a baking dish, ensuring they fit snugly. Brush or spray with olive oil and grill until warmed through and golden, 5-8 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67de33ec33388b05bf552a04/step-f7187920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine cucumber and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide smashed kidney bean taquitos between plates. Dollop over Greek-style yoghurt. Top with cucumber salsa to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67de33ec33388b05bf552a04/step-2edb2e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
